<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli soldiers demolished houses in southern Lebanon and then withdrew, allowing Lebanese villagers to return to damaged homes, while Lebanese President Aoun demanded Israel pull back and warned Iran against interference. An IDF spokesperson visited a Lebanese school, prompting outrage, and the IDF later said sirens in two border communities were false alarms. Israel publicly sent best wishes to Lebanon on its Independence Day, which was observed quietly. The Lebanese army arrested three individuals accused of smuggling explosives from Syria, and the conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxONWpfNGwzcmtvSy1OT1pJMFVoOVdKSmlFRFh1TC1EcnB0bWdBSGhpMDIwN0xVTVd6dG1rNWtSQXlubXVxaW1JWUlsQi1yaU53VjhfY2JFdkt1YmdFVDBzSk9OQU5iMUxQemhpdklVSGZpVHVKNEZjTm5HalFTOV9hUzZ1NjM4UFFGVG5rTGpIVjlhcHcxYy1QbnVuUWhSWDJGZUNLTlBVUHN1UGhPc2pGWC1yOXN6WV9NQlBtcXlvTzhuZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNZnpuclR3SmtTOWFTNWphQmVaa2NuZFZVZXpYQjBKS2Jkb0NjLTZWbjlHNnJqcGh4RWQwd05qbGZfQ2V6YU14b0dMQzRhQ1JSSGw2alJlMzMyZTlNUWljU0NIeWwyS0NwS1VZb1FqN3VDV1dobzhlOVFpdU9UVjFDM0JEaTU3OGUtN2dXODcydkp5RVZSSDcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNN1FEdUg4Y1o3YXVsM1dOeVlDUmJYaTBZeXNDeFdjQmxkWGV4YU1qOXlDVTluUjM2aTE0cUxwZldhQVduajh4Z0pJUG16Q0VDT0VrQUFPaFozNnh6UnMtRGtiakhUd0hhMXp1bDE2cVhRRHE5ZEVOLTlJLXlSXzh3eFBqbjhlaWxRS2hjNV9STnQ5Y1o4ZnRzYmVVQVUzMzdpc1Z6LW5naTd2MUxlNDJCWWxLcm12NEdmekZZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxORll3ZkNWTTRuZ19vOTViOVlJZXlXczJUa0ZOWmN6M